id: pm-slack-global-update-operands
title: Global npm update guard mistakes option values and redirect targets for packages
description: "Follow-up to PR #206 thread PRRT_kwDOSYpJkM64Vsdx: npm update -g --loglevel warn and npm update -g >output currently return no findings. Round AN only changes continuation splitting. A separate line-based operand policy must handle option values and redirections while preserving approved fixtures."
